# Raw/unprocessed camera & drone exports — large source dumps kept locally
# only, several of which exceed GitHub's 100MB per-file limit outright.
# The actual site assets are the compressed copies in the same folders
# (see public/images/README.md for the mapping) — those are explicitly
# un-ignored below since they ARE referenced by code and must ship.
public/images/**/*.MP4
public/images/**/*.mp4
public/images/**/*.mov
!public/images/tours/hero.mp4
!public/images/tours/kayak-tour-3.mp4
!public/images/tours/paddle-board-3.mp4
!public/images/location/cocles-video.mp4
